  "basis": "Reported interest expense before any interest-income offset. The saved 10-K and 10-Q do not state its capitalized-interest basis. Capitalized interest and total interest incurred are Unavailable; neither is assumed zero or added to or subtracted from expense.",
  "composition": "MD&A attributes the increase primarily to higher average borrowings, but does not provide a complete interest-line reconciliation. Finance-lease interest is separately disclosed; whether it is already inside the selected line is Unavailable, so it is not added. The annual revenue policy discusses contract-financing interest in non-operating income (expenses), net. The customer-prepayment notes call related interest immaterial, not zero; no exact amount or reconciliation to the selected line is established.",
  "limitations": "Historical accrual earnings coverage, not cash interest coverage or a repayment forecast. Borrowing-only interest coverage is Unavailable because the reported line's full composition is not established. The revolver uses contract-defined Consolidated EBITDA / Consolidated Net Interest Expense, including specified adjustments; this ratio does not establish covenant headroom, current compliance or drawable credit. No adjusted earnings addbacks are made.",
